{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ciKQupf6UZ1794865288.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國家主席習近平在深圳會見加拿大總理卡尼。</p><p></p><p>卡尼周一晚抵達深圳機場，準備出席周三與周四舉行的亞太經合組織(APEC)第33次領導人非正式會議。預料卡尼與習近平會面時，雙方將討論中國汽車製造業等議題。</p><p></p><p>加拿大和中國今年1月達成協議，加方將中國電動車關稅由百分之100，降至百分至6.1，初期每年容許最多4.9萬輛中國電動車進口，之後逐步增加配額，換取中國同意降低加拿大農產品關稅。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T04:07:49.562476+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":188,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T03:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T12:27:13.177230+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T04:01:15.336767+00:00","content_hash":"1d6cf6ec665b246f44904a6f1aa2ebe7bdf3db4f1fb3e65dbeeb51b8acf1e7c8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T04:07:49.562476+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}